{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":94209,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793325696617,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2020,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lAwSjAmLveLLLagetUCGjGXsVev.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2508633","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"人、神、妖三界失衡的状况持续，神、妖两界救世计划推进中。苏莫婷依旧过着 “月光” 社畜生活，天机星和地魁也陪伴在侧。一次偶然，他们发现人类世界的异常能量波动，疑似与三界失衡有关，为探寻真相，三人踏上新的冒险，就此开启了本季令人啼笑皆非的故事 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-11-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yq948kw9rsB7t1HnfI6dTk3aEvb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yq948kw9rsB7t1HnfI6dTk3aEvb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"2508634","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷所在公司接到一个紧急项目，需要频繁改稿。这可苦了身为社畜的她，疲惫不堪。天机星和地魁见状，想帮忙却状况百出。改稿过程中，客户各种奇葩要求不断，苏莫婷濒临崩溃。关键时刻，地魁运用妖界智慧，帮她找到应对思路，最终勉强完成任务，可苏莫婷也深刻体会到社畜的艰难 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-11-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":16,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mUceiEQtjarDRnbKpOCuRDjpmT1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUceiEQtjarDRnbKpOCuRDjpmT1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"2508635","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷的父母为她安排了相亲，她无奈赴约。相亲对象王小宝性格奇葩，让苏莫婷头疼不已。天机星和地魁担心苏莫婷，悄悄跟去观察。相亲过程中状况连连，王小宝的奇怪举动和言论不断，还引发了一些意外状况，天机星和地魁则在一旁暗中捣乱，这场相亲闹剧让苏莫婷尴尬又无语 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-11-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dklRQY2vxOc0081dJny2FhwMU4w.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dklRQY2vxOc0081dJny2FhwMU4w.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"2534836","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"双十一购物狂欢节来临，苏莫婷为了优惠疯狂计算规则，忙得不可开交。天机星和地魁看着苏莫婷的样子，对人类的购物狂热感到不解。苏莫婷为了凑满减，各种商品加购、比价，甚至熬夜等待零点下单。地魁告诉她在妖界消费没这么复杂，可苏莫婷依旧沉迷其中，结果到最后还是陷入了月光困境 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-11-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":12,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thjgCcpZ8SfbasanyaqKzWnAM9Y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/thjgCcpZ8SfbasanyaqKzWnAM9Y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"2546411","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷和天机星、地魁在生活中发现了贫富差距的现象，他们看到富有的人生活奢华，而一些普通人却为生活奔波。为了深入了解，三人决定去体验不同阶层的生活。苏莫婷在体验过程中，看到了生活的艰辛与不易，也明白了珍惜眼前的道理，同时对三界失衡对人类生活的影响有了更深感悟 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-12-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5mmdHKFLy4QVzYApvlDIiQzINv0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5mmdHKFLy4QVzYApvlDIiQzINv0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"2556145","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷宅家许久，家中卫生状况堪忧，还引来了 “四害”。“四害” 化作人形，与苏莫婷等人展开了一场 “公寓争夺战”。地魁用《六国论》之理分析局势，苏莫婷和天机星则与 “四害” 斗智斗勇。最终，苏莫婷用蚊帐成功打败 “四害”，打扫了房间，但 “四害” 却找到了新的栖息地，让人哭笑不得 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-12-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":15,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcHWiGAehgQSR5diM3xJbTWFVZA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcHWiGAehgQSR5diM3xJbTWFVZA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"2568737","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷患上了拖延症，很多事情都拖到最后一刻才做。天机星和地魁想帮她改掉这个毛病，于是模仿童话故事中的情节来提醒她。苏莫婷在经历了一系列类似童话场景的事件后，虽然有所触动，但依旧难以克服拖延的习惯。直到最后期限来临，她才手忙脚乱地完成任务，深刻认识到拖延的危害 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-12-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/11cVeh6CnHiNOzAUsesP8fejb6G.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11cVeh6CnHiNOzAUsesP8fejb6G.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"2590576","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷失眠了，整晚辗转反侧。天机星和地魁为了帮她入睡，尝试了各种方法，比如数羊、播放舒缓音乐等，但都无济于事。苏莫婷在失眠中回忆起生活中的种种压力，越发难以入眠。最后，地魁用妖界的特殊方法，让苏莫婷的身心逐渐放松，终于进入了梦乡 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-12-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":14,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqRoYbHYACFZJuxUqpPVAhgu7bc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nqRoYbHYACFZJuxUqpPVAhgu7bc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"2612990","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"某公司举办发布会，各种夸张的宣传和 “放卫星” 式的承诺让苏莫婷等人感到震惊。他们决定深入调查，发现背后存在虚假宣传的问题。天机星、地魁和苏莫婷运用各自的能力，揭露了发布会的虚假本质，引发了公众关注，也让大家对商业宣传的真实性有了更多思考 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/efaHG1GVhCFSTvntWpmk3WV9raY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/efaHG1GVhCFSTvntWpmk3WV9raY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"2629179","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷等人卷入了一场追星风波，他们加入了理智粉阵营。在与其他粉丝群体的争斗中，苏莫婷小队起初占上风。然而，随着争斗升级，他们发现追星逐渐偏离了初衷。最后，因为 “贫穷”，苏莫婷等人顿悟追星应追求更好的自己，若没让自己变得优秀就失去了意义，于是放弃争夺，选择回归平静生活 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":17,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ykDXTSWdoUPjLUv59X1lBGk4vj3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ykDXTSWdoUPjLUv59X1lBGk4vj3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"2651032","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"苏莫婷发现自己陷入了时间循环，每天重复着同样的事情。她试图找出打破循环的方法，和天机星、地魁一起尝试了各种行动。在循环过程中，他们对生活中的细节有了新的认识，也逐渐明白一些之前忽略的道理，可打破循环的方法依旧扑朔迷离 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":14,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xSi55PWyUTBZzqjQXsyQ9R4qbd5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xSi55PWyUTBZzqjQXsyQ9R4qbd5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"2676231","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"在上一集时间循环的基础上，苏莫婷等人继续努力。他们不断调整行动，从不同角度去尝试打破循环。经过多次失败，苏莫婷终于找到关键，成功打破时间循环，回归正常生活。这次经历让三人对生活有了全新的感悟，也让他们更加珍惜每一个当下 。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/XZiysId8cXeg0zqdD5vfzYRz0a.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/XZiysId8cXeg0zqdD5vfzYRz0a.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94209/season/2"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793325696617,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793325696617,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793325696617,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793325696617,"status":"o